Yes, but it already exists in core.
```gdscript
class MutexLock extends RefCounted:
	var mutex: Mutex

	func _init(m: Mutex):
		mutex = m
		mutex.lock()

	func _notification(what):
		if what == NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE:
			mutex.unlock()
```

Note that NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE may not be intended to be visible (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/45960#issuecomment-778650675) so this implementation is dubious.
